 "name": "american_bison_face",
 "description": "American bison bull head and hump seen from the front: broad shaggy dark head, curly forehead mop, two short black horns curving up and in with grey tips at about (+-170,-170), small wide-set half-lidded eyes (flat, unimpressed), dark muzzle with two nostrils, long beard hanging to the bottom, hump rising behind; hump and chest run down to y +340 so the cut edge stays off-frame at close-up scales. Mouth is a short flat line, not a smile. Anchor centre, x -230..+230, y -260..+340.",
